error: `#[field(index = "gin", unique)]` on `payload`: PostgreSQL unique indexes are btree-only, so a non-btree `index = "gin"` combined with `unique` is ambiguous. Either: (a) use `#[field(index = "btree", unique)]` (or just `#[field(unique)]`), (b) drop `unique` if a non-unique `gin` lookup index is what you want, or (c) keep `#[field(unique)]` and declare the secondary `gin` index at the model level via `#[model(indexes(index(fields = [payload], using = "gin")))]`.
